    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d138-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d138-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 62 D 181, CF 839. Top Secret;
                        SEATO. This report originally formed
                    Appendix A 5 to MA 6th M (Report of the Sixth Meeting of the SEATO Military Advisers) dated March 10. MA 6th M
                    has not been found in Department of State files.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f2" n="2" xml:id="d138-f2-content">
                <p>Detailed military and intelligence studies mentioned in this paper have not been
                    found in Department of State files.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d138-f3" n="3" xml:id="d138-f3-content">
                <p>MA 3rd M has not been found in Department of State files. The Baguio meeting was
                    held in September 1956.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
